2. List ko traverse karna
numbers = [10, 20, 30, 40, 50]

for i in range(len(numbers)):
    print(numbers[i])


Yahan:
- len(numbers) → list mein 5 elements hain.
- range(len(numbers)) → indexes 0, 1, 2, 3, 4.
- numbers[i] → us index par rakhi actual value.
Time complexity: \(O(n)\), kyunki har element ko ek baar visit karte hain.


